    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Legendary (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>Black and scarlet clouds of foreboding magic swirl inside this crystal orb. While touching it, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHex0000000]{Hex} or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying} (save DC 17) with it.</p><p>In addition, when a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself succeeds on a D20 Test, you can take a Reaction to turn the roll into a 1. Once used, this property can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
